Soil Management System
This is my DBMS college project. It is made to store and manage soil details like farmer name, location, soil type, pH value, nutrients, moisture and recommended crops.
Technologies Used
- HTML
- CSS
- PHP
- MySQL
- XAMPP
Features
- Add soil details
- View soil records
- Edit soil records
- Delete soil records
- Search soil records
Database
Database name: soil_management

Table name: soil_records

The SQL file contains the table structure and sample data.
